UI.Nation.PerCapitaGDPHelp2=The Economy and Spoils priorities each increase Per Capita GDP by ${0} per {1}.
UI.Nation.GDPHelp1=A nation's GDP, or Gross Domestic Product, is a measure of its annual economic output in U.S. dollars adjusted by purchasing power parity. The nation's GDP determines how many Control Points a nation has, how many Investment Points it produces, and how difficult certain missions there are. GDP increases from both the Economy and Spoils priorities are included in the 31-day GDP change above.
UI.Nation.HarmonizationMissingClaim=The receiving nation has no claim on this region, so the transfer would be hostile.
UI.Nation.HarmonizationInvalid=Harmonization cannot be calculated from the current national GDP per capita values, so peaceful integration is unavailable.
UI.Nation.HarmonizationHistorical=historical
UI.Nation.HarmonizationOrdinary=ordinary
UI.Nation.HarmonizationClaimScore=Harmonization score: {0} / {1} ({2} claim). Components: Government {3}, Inequality {4}, Knowledge {5}, GDP/c ratio {6}; stability/cohesion modifier {7}.
UI.Nation.HarmonizationFederationNoLink=Federation harmonization: no cross-boundary claim link (maximum score {0}).
UI.Nation.HarmonizationFederationInvalid=Federation harmonization cannot be calculated from the current national GDP per capita values.
UI.Nation.HarmonizationFederationScore=Best federation harmonization: {0} / {1}, using {2}'s claim on {3}.
UI.Nation.EEO.InvestmentPoints=Monthly Investment Points<br/><br/>These represent the nation's economic surplus that can be allocated by factions with Control Points in the Priorities tab. The value is set by the nation's GDP and reduced by the upkeep of its armies, navies, Mission Control facilities, launch facilities and Funding commitments, enemy occupations of its territory, and high levels of unrest.
UI.Nation.EEO.MissionControlPenalty=-Mission Control facilities are reducing this nation's Investment Points by {0} per Mission Control, for a total penalty of {1}.
UI.Nation.EEO.BoostPenalty=-Launch facilities are reducing this nation's Investment Points by {0} per unit of monthly Boost production, for a total penalty of {1}.
UI.Nation.EEO.FundingPenalty=-Funding commitments are reducing this nation's Investment Points by {0} per $1,000 of monthly Funding, for a total penalty of {1}.
UI.Nation.EEO.ArmyRepairDebt=-Army repairs have left {0} Investment Points of debt. Investment in Military, Build Army, Build Navy and Nuclear Weapons pays this debt before funding further development.
UI.Nation.EEO.Boost=Monthly Boost<br/><br/>This is how much Boost the nation produces each month, in dekatons, and the maximum monthly Boost production it can currently build.
